    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im on ritalin for my adhd and finals are next week and im super stressed. i feel like the dose i get isn't quite enough to keep me locked in for these long study sessions. would it be okay if i drink a few monster energy drinks or maybe take some caffeine pills with my meds to get an extra boost? just need to stay focused lol",
